  "descriptionHtml": "<div class='product-description'>'<p>Ghost your limits and discover a new level of running bliss! Designed for avid runners and walkers, the Brooks Ghost Max 3 transforms every stride into something supernatural. Featuring soft cushioning and a rocker shape, these shoes smooth your transition from landing to toe-off, delivering a comfy, cloud-like ride. Your new best friend on the road to fitness, the Brooks Ghost Max 3 reduces pressure underfoot and keeps you supported and protected mile after mile.</p> <ul> <li>High-quality materials offer comfort and durability.</li> <li>Broad base adds stability.</li> </ul><hr /><p>Long walks, recovery miles, and full days on your feet feel easier in the Brooks Ghost Max 3. Designed for runners and walkers who want a smooth, highly cushioned ride, it combines soft underfoot comfort with a stable platform and rocker geometry to help each step flow from landing to toe-off.</p><ul><li>Soft cushioning helps reduce underfoot pressure.</li><li>Rocker-shaped design promotes smooth transitions.</li><li>Broad base adds a stable, grounded feel.</li><li>Breathable upper supports everyday comfort.</li></ul>  <p><strong>Size &amp; Fit Guidance</strong></p><p>For the best fit, most reviewers say their usual size works well, with a roomy forefoot that feels especially comfortable through the toe box. If you prefer a little more space up front or wear orthotics, the accommodating shape may be a plus.</p>  <p><strong>Best For</strong></p><p>Best for daily walks, easy runs, recovery miles, and long hours of standing when comfort and support are the priority.</p>  <p><strong>Cushioning &amp; Road Feel</strong></p><p>Reviewers consistently highlight the plush, protective ride, often describing it as soft without feeling overly squishy. The feel underfoot leans smooth and supportive, making it a strong choice for steady miles and everyday movement rather than a stripped-down, minimal road shoe.</p>  <p><strong>Break-In &amp; Durability</strong></p><p>Most reviewers say the Ghost Max 3 feels comfortable right out of the box with little to no break-in time. For walking, standing, and regular training use, it earns strong marks for lasting comfort, while high-mileage runners may want to refresh pairs once the cushioning no longer feels as lively.</p>  <p><strong>Care &amp; Maintenance</strong></p><p>A quick wipe-down helps keep the upper looking fresh, especially on lighter colorways. Some reviewers also recommend checking the sockliner occasionally and brushing away small debris to keep the underfoot feel smooth.</p>\"</div>\n\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin: 20px 0;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Specifications</h3>\n  <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px;\">\n    <tbody><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Brand</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Brooks</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Model</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Brooks Ghost Max 3 - Men's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Gender</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Men's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Color</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Acid Lime/Navy/Black</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Width</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Width - D - Medium</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Material</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Premium upper with durable overlays and responsive traction outsole</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Manufacturer SKU</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>110464-078</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Category</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Shoes</td></tr></tbody>\n  </table>\n</div>\n\n\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin: 20px 0; padding: 12px; border: 1px solid #e0e0e0; border-radius: 6px;\">\n  <summary style=\"fo